WEBVTT

00:01.890 --> 00:06.860
<b>The anti-peace faction that gained traction in Ctrigall has been almost completely suppressed.</b>

00:07.320 --> 00:09.860
<b>However, some remnants managed to escape</b>

00:10.320 --> 00:13.490
<b>and are likely looking to meet up with other powers.</b>

00:16.370 --> 00:19.200
<b>As such, we're requesting the assistance of your squad,</b>

00:19.790 --> 00:22.290
<b>Naval Captain Dietfried Bougainvillea.</b>

00:24.320 --> 00:26.080
<b>Why ask me and not the army?</b>

00:26.080 --> 00:28.090
<b>I belong to the navy.</b>

00:30.510 --> 00:32.760
<b>As you're aware,</b>

00:32.760 --> 00:37.850
<b>the future of the continent rests on the upcoming peace treaty signing ceremony.</b>

00:38.430 --> 00:42.890
<b>We want to take all possible measures to prevent any interference.</b>

00:43.890 --> 00:46.900
<b>In addition, the army's special task force has disbanded,</b>

00:46.900 --> 00:49.360
<b>leaving us shorthanded in case of an emergency.</b>

00:49.770 --> 00:53.190
<b>But fortunately, your squad is still active,</b>

00:53.190 --> 00:56.490
<b>and the navy is perfect for this operation.</b>

00:58.910 --> 01:03.830
<b>Now that the man who used to clean up your messes is gone, you ask his older brother?</b>

01:07.210 --> 01:11.590
<b>The radicals are certain to try and disrupt the peace talks.</b>

01:13.420 --> 01:15.930
<b>Do you have some idea what they may be planning?</b>

01:17.340 --> 01:24.520
<b>In three days, an ambassador and a civilian Doll will be taking the transcontinental railroad</b>

01:24.520 --> 01:27.100
<b>from Distery to Gardariki as envoys of peace.</b>

01:27.100 --> 01:28.940
<b>This is a risky move.</b>

01:29.690 --> 01:31.610
<b>We can't have another war breaking out.</b>

01:32.360 --> 01:34.530
<b>You may use the troops in the area as you please.</b>

01:35.490 --> 01:37.200
<b>Foil their plans, no matter what.</b>

01:40.780 --> 01:42.370
<b>"Peace," huh?</b>

