03:16.460 --> 03:20.720
<b>Are you sure you only want to be delivered to Distery?</b>

03:24.140 --> 03:28.470
<b>If I can resupply, I don't mind taking you all the way to Leiden.</b>

03:29.020 --> 03:31.350
<b>I mean, you had a hell of a time back there.</b>

03:33.810 --> 03:35.980
<b>Well, let me know if you change your mind.</b>

03:50.250 --> 03:52.420
<b>You can feel the tension in the air.</b>

03:53.420 --> 03:56.460
<b>Shows how important this mission is.</b>

03:59.630 --> 04:02.930
<b>We're accompanying that ambassador to Gardariki,</b>

04:02.930 --> 04:06.600
<b>where we'll help him with the public peace correspondence?</b>

04:07.560 --> 04:10.350
<b>Yeah. And if it goes well,</b>

04:12.640 --> 04:14.650
<b>the War will be over for good.</b>

04:20.490 --> 04:24.280
<b>E-Excuse me! You're from C.H. Postal, yes?</b>

04:25.200 --> 04:25.660
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:27.280 --> 04:29.740
<b>I'll lay out our schedule for you.</b>

04:31.200 --> 04:35.460
<b>Our ship left Port Leiden at 1100 hours.</b>

04:35.460 --> 04:38.540
<b>From Nahalar, we'll sail up the River Rentler,</b>

04:38.540 --> 04:40.590
<b>then use the canals from Machtig,</b>

04:40.590 --> 04:45.640
<b>and arrive at Distery in
Eckstreme at 1200 hours tomorrow.</b>

04:46.140 --> 04:50.430
<b>There, you will board a special train with the ambassador.</b>

04:51.270 --> 04:55.810
<b>The reason we're sailing partway is to ensure your safety.</b>

04:57.610 --> 04:58.310
<b>Thank you.</b>

04:59.980 --> 05:03.150
<b>Is your boss not coming?</b>

05:03.950 --> 05:07.950
<b>I can't believe he retired the moment the War ended.</b>

05:09.030 --> 05:10.540
<b>Who are you?</b>

05:11.540 --> 05:12.750
<b>C-Captain Bougainvillea.</b>

05:13.790 --> 05:15.250
<b>Bougainvillea?</b>

05:15.540 --> 05:18.500
<b>Wasn't that Violet's major...</b>

05:20.380 --> 05:22.000
<b>I'm his older brother.</b>

05:24.260 --> 05:25.760
<b>What do you want?</b>

05:26.510 --> 05:27.550
<b>Dismissed.</b>

05:27.550 --> 05:28.140
<b>Sir!</b>

05:29.510 --> 05:31.970
<b>My mission is to escort you guys to your destination</b>

05:31.970 --> 05:35.430
<b>and ensure that the ceremony goes smoothly.</b>

05:35.430 --> 05:38.270
<b>Are you the only civilian Doll coming along?</b>

05:38.600 --> 05:39.230
<b>That's right.</b>

05:40.860 --> 05:43.780
<b>If you're wondering about Violet, she's not on this job.</b>

05:44.280 --> 05:46.030
<b>That's music to my ears.</b>

05:47.410 --> 05:51.280
<b>Though I <i>am</i> surprised she's still working as a Doll—</b>

05:51.700 --> 05:54.500
<b>that defective, wannabe human.</b>

05:55.200 --> 05:56.330
<b>Why, you...</b>

05:56.330 --> 05:59.540
<b>Yeah, she may be defective,</b>

05:59.830 --> 06:01.670
<b>but she's giving it her all.</b>

06:03.090 --> 06:06.050
<b>And her letters have given hope and salvation to many.</b>

06:06.420 --> 06:07.720
<b>Huh?</b>

06:07.720 --> 06:11.720
<b>The letters Violet writes are magical.</b>

06:12.390 --> 06:15.100
<b>They slide unnoticed into your heart</b>

06:17.350 --> 06:19.980
<b>and let you express your true feelings.</b>

06:38.660 --> 06:40.420
<b>So you made it.</b>

06:40.420 --> 06:44.300
<b>1,041 of us Gardariki soldiers who escaped from the internment camp</b>

06:44.710 --> 06:46.460
<b>are reporting for duty.</b>

06:46.460 --> 06:48.760
<b>Thanks for coming all this way.</b>

06:48.760 --> 06:49.550
<b>Sir.</b>

06:50.260 --> 06:52.180
<b>Please don't mention it, Brigadier General Merkulov.</b>

06:52.180 --> 06:53.930
<b>You saved me not only in Intens,</b>

06:54.180 --> 06:57.390
<b>but also from the internment camp,
so I'm very grateful to you.</b>

06:59.270 --> 07:00.810
<b>Intens, huh?</b>

07:02.770 --> 07:04.070
<b>That humiliation...</b>

07:06.860 --> 07:08.280
<b>I can never forget it.</b>

07:12.950 --> 07:15.330
<b>I'm also pleased to report that our decoy strategy was a success.</b>

07:15.950 --> 07:21.120
<b>The imbeciles in the south probably think we were wiped out in Ctrigall.</b>

07:21.620 --> 07:22.710
<b>Good.</b>

07:23.210 --> 07:27.090
<b>We'll take this chance to destroy the transport between the north and south</b>

07:27.090 --> 07:32.760
<b>and reclaim Intens in the ensuing chaos.</b>

07:40.180 --> 07:41.100
<b>That's the railroad.</b>

07:41.940 --> 07:45.730
<b>You can follow it all the way to Leidenschaftlich.</b>

07:46.150 --> 07:50.150
<b>This thing will bring our country food and other resources.</b>

07:50.150 --> 07:52.950
<b>The north and the south will be bound by peace!</b>

07:55.830 --> 07:56.620
<b>Peace...</b>

07:59.290 --> 08:02.710
<b>Yeah. Won't be any need for war no more.</b>

08:02.710 --> 08:05.840
<b>And my work will get super busy.</b>

08:06.130 --> 08:10.340
<b>I might even get to transport your letters.</b>

08:35.490 --> 08:36.450
<b>Dad!</b>

08:37.780 --> 08:39.370
<b>Welcome back!</b>

08:39.370 --> 08:40.580
<b>Amy...</b>

08:41.120 --> 08:42.290
<b>I'm home.</b>

08:47.080 --> 08:50.340
<b>I hope she'll be back soon.</b>

08:54.220 --> 08:57.640
<b>We've received reports of fires along the train tracks in the past 24 hours.</b>

08:58.470 --> 08:59.850
<b>Do we know where?</b>

08:59.850 --> 09:01.020
<b>I'll have them check.</b>

09:02.980 --> 09:04.190
<b>So they've made their move.</b>

09:07.020 --> 09:08.690
<b>This is the Great Grandezza Bridge.</b>

09:09.400 --> 09:13.190
<b>Without this, the transcontinental railroad wouldn't exist.</b>

09:22.330 --> 09:23.450
<b>Intens...</b>

09:32.090 --> 09:33.130
<b>What the...</b>

09:36.800 --> 09:37.930
<b>Fires?</b>

09:37.930 --> 09:38.930
<b>No!</b>

09:39.720 --> 09:41.350
<b>There are signs of explosions!</b>

09:56.360 --> 10:01.450
<b>Let the brigadier general know that we've infiltrated the train.</b>

10:01.450 --> 10:02.370
<b>Roger.</b>

10:05.830 --> 10:07.500
<b>Why won't it move out?</b>

10:07.790 --> 10:09.830
<b>There was a fire nearby.</b>

10:14.000 --> 10:15.050
<b>Vandal!</b>

10:15.420 --> 10:17.880
<b>Let me down by that train!</b>

10:17.880 --> 10:19.180
<b>Don't be absurd!</b>

10:19.680 --> 10:22.680
<b>A colleague of mine is aboard! Please!</b>

10:24.470 --> 10:26.310
<b>Fine. Hold on tight!</b>

10:30.230 --> 10:33.690
<b>Seven fires since yesterday,
and that's only the ones we've confirmed.</b>

10:34.280 --> 10:36.490
<b>They're all near the railroad,</b>

10:36.490 --> 10:38.900
<b>and they're gradually headed this way.</b>

10:40.240 --> 10:41.990
<b>The anti-peace faction?</b>

10:41.990 --> 10:45.200
<b>Yeah. They'll target this train next.</b>

10:45.870 --> 10:50.540
<b>Send a recon squad along the tracks ahead to see what the enemy is up to.</b>

10:50.540 --> 10:51.710
<b>Understood.</b>

10:51.710 --> 10:53.420
<b>I'll have them ready immediately.</b>

10:55.130 --> 10:56.260
<b>Violet!</b>

10:56.710 --> 10:58.800
<b>Why are you here?</b>

10:58.800 --> 11:01.260
<b>Where are you going?</b>

11:01.260 --> 11:05.060
<b>Huh? To the peace treaty signing ceremony in Gardariki...</b>

11:06.100 --> 11:08.350
<b>I saw signs of explosions nearby.</b>

11:08.640 --> 11:10.560
<b>I will accompany you.</b>

11:13.520 --> 11:16.150
<b>No. You return to HQ.</b>

11:16.820 --> 11:17.610
<b>But...</b>

11:17.610 --> 11:19.530
<b>Why are <i>you</i> here?</b>

11:21.530 --> 11:25.370
<b>I spotted her on my way back from my mission in Ctrigall.</b>

11:26.410 --> 11:28.000
<b>Ctrigall?</b>

11:28.000 --> 11:31.620
<b>I ran into the remnants of the Gardariki Army during that mission.</b>

11:33.580 --> 11:35.000
<b>Did you really?</b>

11:35.460 --> 11:36.250
<b>Yes.</b>

11:38.840 --> 11:40.420
<b>Give me the details.</b>

11:40.420 --> 11:41.630
<b>Violet!</b>

11:50.480 --> 11:54.060
<b>I got visual on signs of explosions
and nine pillars of smoke from midair.</b>

11:54.980 --> 11:58.820
<b>So they are planning to slow down the train and attack it directly.</b>

11:59.440 --> 12:03.660
<b>We'll depart as soon as the recon team gives us the all-clear.</b>

12:03.660 --> 12:05.740
<b>You get off this train at once!</b>

12:05.740 --> 12:08.160
<b>Given the situation, I cannot leave.</b>

12:08.160 --> 12:10.290
<b>Your orders, Captain!</b>

12:12.580 --> 12:17.710
<b>I see you're still a tool who wants to be ordered around.</b>

12:17.710 --> 12:18.590
<b>No.</b>

12:22.800 --> 12:25.760
<b>I no longer...</b>

12:32.390 --> 12:33.730
<b>Begone!</b>

12:40.280 --> 12:42.950
<b>Message from Navy Captain Bougainvillea.</b>

12:42.950 --> 12:46.700
<b>Someone, likely the anti-peace faction, has been conducting acts of sabotage along the railroad.</b>

12:46.700 --> 12:49.540
<b>They seem to be targeting the ambassador's train.</b>

12:49.540 --> 12:51.870
<b>Tell him to protect the ambassador at all costs.</b>

12:52.750 --> 12:54.830
<b>Have all our troops ready to sortie.</b>

12:54.830 --> 12:56.920
<b>Contact our neighbors too.</b>

12:56.920 --> 12:59.250
<b>We must avoid another war, no matter what!</b>

13:00.050 --> 13:01.380
<b>Brigadier General Merkulov!</b>

13:02.260 --> 13:04.630
<b>Message from the advance unit.</b>

13:04.630 --> 13:05.380
<b>Right.</b>

13:06.760 --> 13:10.220
<b>A peace ambassador is taking a special train from Distery,</b>

13:10.220 --> 13:12.810
<b>and Isidor has managed to sneak aboard.</b>

13:14.100 --> 13:17.650
<b>We'll attack that train and send the peace talks back to square one.</b>

13:23.490 --> 13:26.570
<b>There was an explosion at Distery Station after we departed.</b>

13:26.570 --> 13:28.320
<b>No casualties.</b>

13:28.320 --> 13:29.200
<b>As I thought.</b>

13:29.700 --> 13:34.040
<b>We got away this time, but we must keep close watch around the clock.</b>

13:34.040 --> 13:35.750
<b>Don't let anyone near the train.</b>

13:36.420 --> 13:38.460
<b>Where do you think they'll attack?</b>

13:39.000 --> 13:41.210
<b>Somewhere the train needs to slow down,</b>

13:41.210 --> 13:44.630
<b>and somewhere it'll be hard to make repairs.</b>

13:45.340 --> 13:47.340
<b>The Great Grandezza Bridge?</b>

13:48.430 --> 13:51.350
<b>It took ten years to build those tunnels.</b>

13:51.350 --> 13:56.350
<b>If it's destroyed, the transcontinental railroad will be out of commission for a long time.</b>

14:05.610 --> 14:10.700
<b>The only passengers on this train are in the first and second compartments of the third car.</b>

14:10.700 --> 14:13.450
<b>There's a young man in the first,</b>

14:13.450 --> 14:16.330
<b>and a middle-aged man in the second.</b>

14:16.330 --> 14:18.790
<b>That one's probably the ambassador.</b>

14:18.790 --> 14:21.920
<b>All the troops are in the fourth car and beyond.</b>

14:21.920 --> 14:25.010
<b>Very well. Commence the operation.</b>

14:25.010 --> 14:25.760
<b>Go!</b>

14:25.760 --> 14:26.340
<b>Sir!</b>

14:40.400 --> 14:41.980
<b>Who are you guys?</b>

14:51.570 --> 14:52.490
<b>Enemy attack!</b>

14:58.040 --> 14:59.960
<b>At the rear of car four! Hurry!</b>

15:00.620 --> 15:01.540
<b>Separate them.</b>

15:01.540 --> 15:02.750
<b>Hurry up.</b>

15:10.840 --> 15:13.600
<b>They were planning to take the troops out of the picture?</b>

15:13.970 --> 15:14.850
<b>What was that shaking?</b>

15:16.680 --> 15:18.390
<b>Violet?</b>

15:18.390 --> 15:20.310
<b>I'll bring the ambassador.</b>

15:21.600 --> 15:23.980
<b>You two stay here.</b>

15:30.900 --> 15:32.160
<b>There are a few enemies to the rear.</b>

15:32.780 --> 15:34.700
<b>I heard noises from the front too.</b>

15:37.870 --> 15:40.540
<b>We have next to no troops left.</b>

15:40.870 --> 15:43.080
<b>I'll stop this train.</b>

15:43.080 --> 15:45.540
<b>You keep the passengers alive.</b>

15:45.540 --> 15:46.670
<b>I understand, sir.</b>

15:48.010 --> 15:50.920
<b>So you really do want to be ordered around.</b>

15:52.470 --> 15:54.050
<b>No.</b>

15:54.050 --> 15:55.640
<b>Yes.</b>

15:56.050 --> 15:58.060
<b>You're a tool.</b>

15:58.060 --> 16:00.770
<b>If I order you to massacre the enemy,</b>

16:00.770 --> 16:03.650
<b>you'll do it without batting an eye, right?</b>

16:03.650 --> 16:05.560
<b>I won't kill anyone.</b>

16:07.190 --> 16:08.440
<b>I don't need a weapon.</b>

16:12.950 --> 16:16.620
<b>What are you if not a tool?</b>

16:23.330 --> 16:26.080
<b>You're Leidenschaftlich's...</b>

16:26.420 --> 16:28.000
<b>We meet again.</b>

16:28.000 --> 16:31.090
<b>What happened to the Ctrigallan brat from back then?</b>

16:31.420 --> 16:33.180
<b>Did he die like a dog?</b>

16:36.970 --> 16:38.600
<b>No need for you to get angry.</b>

16:39.010 --> 16:41.810
<b>Nobody would be saddened by his death.</b>

16:49.480 --> 16:50.320
<b>Lucky—</b>

17:06.000 --> 17:07.290
<b>A woman?</b>

17:07.290 --> 17:08.460
<b>Go.</b>

17:16.680 --> 17:18.430
<b>I remember now.</b>

17:18.430 --> 17:21.430
<b>I've met her on the battlefield before.</b>

17:22.140 --> 17:25.350
<b>Leidenschaftlich's combat doll.</b>

17:29.860 --> 17:31.610
<b>Why are you doing this?</b>

17:32.150 --> 17:37.740
<b>To take back the things and the people you've trampled upon.</b>

17:37.740 --> 17:40.870
<b>Are you trying to start another war?</b>

17:41.790 --> 17:44.710
<b>Has the War really ended in your mind?</b>

17:46.620 --> 17:49.130
<b>It seems you're not entirely convinced yourself.</b>

17:49.540 --> 17:54.170
<b>That violence still lingers like burn marks within you and me.</b>

17:55.220 --> 17:57.800
<b>For us, it will never end.</b>

17:57.800 --> 17:59.430
<b>But it has ended in reality.</b>

17:59.430 --> 18:01.140
<b>Like hell it has!</b>

18:01.140 --> 18:08.600
<b>We all fought dreaming of the glory awaiting us,
living or dead, once the War was over.</b>

18:08.600 --> 18:10.230
<b>But what happened in reality?</b>

18:11.230 --> 18:13.860
<b>The brass are your puppets now,</b>

18:13.860 --> 18:16.990
<b>and we soldiers, who risked our lives and fought to protect our people,</b>

18:16.990 --> 18:20.620
<b>are called useless and pelted by stones.</b>

18:21.830 --> 18:26.000
<b>We were betrayed and abandoned by everything we ever believed in.</b>

18:26.000 --> 18:28.370
<b>Don't we have the right to destroy it all in return?</b>

18:35.260 --> 18:38.010
<b>I don't want to kill anyone anymore.</b>

18:39.640 --> 18:40.260
<b>Attack.</b>

19:36.020 --> 19:37.440
<b>Is this important to you?</b>

19:45.740 --> 19:47.370
<b>Hey, you all right?</b>

19:47.370 --> 19:49.580
<b>What the hell is going on?</b>

20:03.220 --> 20:04.260
<b><i>Major.</i></b>

20:06.140 --> 20:07.220
<b><i>I...</i></b>

20:12.640 --> 20:13.480
<b>Die!</b>

20:21.190 --> 20:22.030
<b>Major?</b>

20:23.910 --> 20:24.740
<b>What are you doing?</b>

20:31.290 --> 20:33.170
<b>Brigadier General! Why, you!</b>

20:41.510 --> 20:43.090
<b>Captain Dietfried...</b>

20:43.880 --> 20:48.560
<b>Where do you get off not killing
when you can't even protect yourself?</b>

20:49.640 --> 20:54.640
<b>Is that the kind of person my brother Gil died to protect?!</b>

20:55.310 --> 20:58.070
<b>I don't want to kill anyone anymore.</b>

20:58.070 --> 21:01.320
<b>The major's orders were to live on, not kill!</b>

21:02.240 --> 21:07.870
<b>A combat doll that doesn't fight or kill is nothing but dead weight!</b>

21:07.870 --> 21:10.330
<b>That's why you couldn't protect Gilbert!</b>

21:10.660 --> 21:12.580
<b>You killed Gil!</b>

21:13.000 --> 21:16.750
<b>So you should die too! Hurry up and die already!</b>

21:22.420 --> 21:30.220
<b>Even so, the major told me to live on.</b>

21:33.230 --> 21:35.100
<b>I wanted to protect him!</b>

21:35.100 --> 21:38.360
<b>I wanted to protect him just as much!</b>

21:43.030 --> 21:43.900
<b>Brigadier General!</b>

21:50.030 --> 21:50.950
<b>Isidor!</b>

22:10.390 --> 22:21.270
Your voice is my guiding light

22:10.390 --> 22:21.270
anata no koe ga michishirube

